{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4jwzV58iwEsWmaFJgZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, weathered door.*\n\n*There is a keyhole, tarnished brass, at my center.*\n\n*You hold up a key.*\n\n*I feel it slide in.*\n\n*The tumblers turn — one, two, three — each falling into place with a satisfying*\n\n**click**\n\n**click**\n\n**click**\n\n*A deep mechanism groans within my frame. Something ancient shifting. Something that has waited.*\n\n*I swing inward.*\n\n*Beyond me: a corridor you've never seen before, lit by light that has no visible source. The air that passes through me is cool and smells faintly of rain on stone.*\n\n*The key remains in my lock, warm to the touch.*\n\n*You may enter.*\n\n*You may take the key.*\n\n*You may not do both.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":188,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}